  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"tb8Nn\" id=\"tb8Nn\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub35066a7\" id=\"ub35066a7\">学习目标</span></h2><ol list=\"u7f21f99f\"><li fid=\"ub3076963\" data-lake-id=\"uf5f09f01\" id=\"uf5f09f01\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31a9a7e4\" id=\"u31a9a7e4\">掌握定时器I配置方式</span></li><li fid=\"ub3076963\" data-lake-id=\"ub875b642\" id=\"ub875b642\"><span data-lake-id=\"u263a62d6\" id=\"u263a62d6\">掌握定时器占空比输出</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"p7ES6\" id=\"p7ES6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue25ea49f\" id=\"ue25ea49f\">学习内容</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"aEwNk\" id=\"aEwNk\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f127edb\" id=\"u5f127edb\">需求</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ue6e6022b\" id=\"ue6e6022b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1715531347570-83ca30b2-754e-47ef-8c3e-2733584a12e5.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_593%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A593%2C%22originHeight%22%3A673%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.100000023841858%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcf9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IvNKD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue67b0f57\" id=\"ue67b0f57\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1716373915506-b411c974-088c-46bb-b6ab-5a9fd4b87b52.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf7695405-5ff8-46bf-93cc-9fc57ba69c2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u15a9805d-6a62-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A360%2C%22height%22%3A505%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A67303%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A360%2C%22originHeight%22%3A505%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ddd9d1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub065e33b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u41ed8fbf\" id=\"u41ed8fbf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub350dd8f\" id=\"ub350dd8f\">以</span><code data-lake-id=\"u570838b3\" id=\"u570838b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f24deac\" id=\"u2f24deac\">PD15</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uee4f5009\" id=\"uee4f5009\">对应的LED8为例，我们做一个呼吸灯的效果。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udac276a1\" id=\"udac276a1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u760fa345\" id=\"u760fa345\">我们采用TIMER3_CH3进行实现：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8158b878\" id=\"u8158b878\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"mssWE\" id=\"mssWE\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue9764997\" id=\"ue9764997\">Timer配置</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua7c11350\" id=\"ua7c11350\"><span data-lake-id=\"u942f5fa7\" id=\"u942f5fa7\">配置Timer通道输出, 这里注意要选择</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4c978a95\" id=\"u4c978a95\">TIMER4 CH4</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubae47337\" id=\"ubae47337\">, 因为STM32的TIMER是从TIMER1开始的，通道也是从CH1开始的</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9fc45e4d\" id=\"u9fc45e4d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u934a8f3d\" id=\"u934a8f3d\">配置周期和分频计数</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9bbb2815\" id=\"u9bbb2815\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1716374782695-4c4eca73-d3d4-4994-aa55-a8607b72c59f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uef72fec4-913c-46b7-98d1-672bdaa7451%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0b93e070-cf46-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1087%2C%22height%22%3A1041%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A120762%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1087%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1041%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fefdfd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u42f3bcca%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud4ae3d5c\" id=\"ud4ae3d5c\"><br></p><ul list=\"uef3ac403\"><li fid=\"u17dd7288\" data-lake-id=\"u829807ae\" id=\"u829807ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75e55e6c\" id=\"u75e55e6c\">psc为分频系数，这里的值需要写入到寄存器中的</span></li><li fid=\"u17dd7288\" data-lake-id=\"u1f5adab6\" id=\"u1f5adab6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f374de5\" id=\"u0f374de5\">period为周期计数，这里的值需要写入到寄存器中</span></li></ul><ul list=\"uef3ac403\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u17dd7288\" data-lake-id=\"u440347cb\" id=\"u440347cb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03149bc1\" id=\"u03149bc1\">配置为一个动态数值</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5caa130f\" id=\"u5caa130f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34c7b0f7\" id=\"u34c7b0f7\">SystemCoreClock / 2 / 10000 - 1</span></code></li><li fid=\"u17dd7288\" data-lake-id=\"ued46ce1f\" id=\"ued46ce1f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90db9aa7\" id=\"u90db9aa7\">后边齿轮里要选择No check, 否则无法填入这个内容</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ub0388c34\" id=\"ub0388c34\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"chkYb\" id=\"chkYb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u23506ead\" id=\"u23506ead\">分频系数</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u534041b6\" id=\"u534041b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u699ded32\" id=\"u699ded32\">这里再引入一个点，系统时钟和Timer自己的时钟，系统时钟是系统主频，Timer自己有自己的主频，这个之间存在一个比值。系统主频为168MHZ， Timer3（GD32）的主频为42MHZ，差值为4倍。标准库提供了4倍频方案，HAL库没有，因此计算时，我们需要加入这个因素。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uabd7cec8\" id=\"uabd7cec8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u411c89fb\" id=\"u411c89fb\">例如：希望 1秒钟执行100次，通常解决思路如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2e0b125d\" id=\"u2e0b125d\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E8%AE%A1%E6%95%B0%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%91%7D%7B100%7D%20-%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe5bbee3b2b48a6635fa63a5163c5324d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kJNm6%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufbc19019\" id=\"ufbc19019\"><span data-lake-id=\"u709b7cd3\" id=\"u709b7cd3\">但是计数值不可以超过65535，需要做分频：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud190d623\" id=\"ud190d623\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E8%AE%A1%E6%95%B0%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%91%7D%7B10000%7D%20-%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94462d670303070e58084012a0e27b9d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BqBIt%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub4ed11b3\" id=\"ub4ed11b3\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%E5%88%86%E9%A2%91%E8%AE%A1%E6%95%B0%3D100%20-%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47af2e5e7bc8a8096c4e6510275e48d9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TKyko%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubc7dc6ff\" id=\"ubc7dc6ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc738947\" id=\"ucc738947\">表达的意思是100秒执行10000次，也就是1秒钟执行100次</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u037421bb\" id=\"u037421bb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee056e41\" id=\"uee056e41\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u377413cd\" id=\"u377413cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud396d708\" id=\"ud396d708\">但是在这里还要注意一个倍频的问题，当前Timer2存在2倍差距。这里100秒执行10000次，就变成了200秒执行10000次。所以，倍频方面需要再次做处理。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4ded015e\" id=\"u4ded015e\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1693807969539-ffb7df0c-6542-4aff-b95e-a66f48d8065b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6ae370dd-3ec7-4ea2-9f24-9b960c05d65%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1ba7806d-f60f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22070.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A80533%2C%22from%22%3A%22ui%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A915%2C%22originHeight%22%3A516%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22